@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "PrivacyPolicy";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/user/information.css" />

<div class="static-hero">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: April 2026</p>
</div>

<div class="static-body">
    <div class="policy-content">
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>When you register on Reach.A.Paw, we collect your name, email address, phone number, and address. When you submit an adoption application, we additionally collect home details, living situation, and pet experience to help shelters make informed decisions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
            <p>We use your information to manage your account, process adoption applications, send OTP verification emails, and notify you of application status updates. We do not use your data for advertising purposes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>3. Information Sharing</h3>
            <p>Your application details are shared with the shelter you apply to, so they can review and process your request. We do not sell or share your personal information with any third parties outside of this process.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>4. Data Security</h3>
            <p>We take reasonable steps to protect your personal information. Your data is stored securely and access is limited to authorized personnel only. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>5. Cookies</h3>
            <p>We use session cookies to keep you logged in during your visit. These are temporary and are cleared when you log out or close your browser. We do not use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>6. Your Rights</h3>
            <p>You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information at any time through your profile settings. If you wish to delete your account entirely, please contact us directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>7. Changes to This Policy</h3>
            <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. Continued use of the platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the new policy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>8. Contact</h3>
            <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please reach out to us through our community forum or contact the shelter directly.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>